A multifunctional app that makes your life easier!

With the DKV App you scan and send your medical expenses easily and quickly. You can also add your Medi-Card®: that way you always have those details at hand! You will also find information in the DKV App about the nearest Belgian hospitals that accept the Medi-Card®, about emergency and on-call services, and about DKV Assistance in case you have a health problem abroad.

·      Submit your medical expenses easily and quickly. With the convenient scan & send function, you can scan your medical expenses and send them immediately to DKV. Result? Faster processing and less administration;
·      Your Medi-Card® always in your pocket. Scan your Medi-Card® with the app, so you have the necessary data at hand anytime, anywhere;
·      Useful information. Are you looking for the contact information of a particular hospital? Or for one of the emergency services or the doctor on call? You'll find plenty of information in the app.
·      Protection abroad. Thanks to DKV Assistance, you are protected in case of hospitalization abroad. In the DKV App you will find the phone number you can call to count on assistance abroad.

Download today and enjoy the peace of mind that comes with never missing a dose again!

With our user-friendly interface, you can easily manage all of your medications in one place, ensuring that you never miss a dose again. Our app is perfect for anyone who struggles to take their medication on time or has to take multiple medications each day. It's also ideal for women who use contraceptives and want to make sure they never miss a dose.

Customize your medication schedule by entering the name of each medicine, the interval between doses, the time of the first dose, the photo and much more. 

With Pill Reminder, you can:

* Schedule all your meds in one easy-to-use app;
* Customize your pills with colors, photos, and notification sounds;
* See the time of your next dose at a glance;
* Receive notifications to remind you to take your medications;
* Track medications that you take as you need;
* See all your intake history.

Pill Reminder - the must-have app for anyone who needs help remembering to take their medication on time. 

Upgrade to the full version to remove ads and add an unlimited number of medications to your schedule.

Read our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use at http://aplicativoslegais.com.br/politica-privacidade/pill-reminder-en.html.

